{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131550/extras/10089696424b89655991beeffd4ebe7f.poster.avif?t=1757916885\" width=616 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131550/extras/10089696424b89655991beeffd4ebe7f.webm?t=1757916885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131550/extras/10089696424b89655991beeffd4ebe7f.mp4?t=1757916885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fishing Online</strong> lets you explore the joy of fishing in beautiful natural settings\u2014online. Join friends or global players and experience a relaxing fishing life together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25a0 The Fun of Fishing</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your fishing journey begins! When you hook a fish, the real challenge begins as you battle to reel it in. Simple controls meet unique fish behavior patterns that deliver that satisfying fishing thrill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131550/extras/800ca7acde7ed2a63476e7c583d44f53.poster.avif?t=1757916885\" width=616 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131550/extras/800ca7acde7ed2a63476e7c583d44f53.webm?t=1757916885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131550/extras/800ca7acde7ed2a63476e7c583d44f53.mp4?t=1757916885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25a0 Stylized Cartoon Graphics</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience nature brought to life through warm, cartoon-style visuals. Rivers, lakes, and a wide range of unique fish await you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25a0 Cooking &amp; Gathering</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise your catches or turn them into tasty meals. Collect ingredients from the wild to cook dishes that provide helpful fishing buffs. You can also craft your own tools.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25a0 Online Play</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect with friends or players worldwide. Explore maps inspired by locations around the globe and enjoy the game together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131550/extras/56c454129bb1ce33feb4f67235111a5c.poster.avif?t=1757916885\" width=616 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131550/extras/56c454129bb1ce33feb4f67235111a5c.webm?t=1757916885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131550/extras/56c454129bb1ce33feb4f67235111a5c.mp4?t=1757916885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25a0 Frequent Updates</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're a small indie development team, but we're committed to listening to player feedback and providing regular updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish Encyclopedia: View your catches, records, and rankings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personal Pond: Raise various fish and decorative species.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fishing Tournaments: Compete globally and earn rewards based on rank.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fishing Area Expansion: Plans to expand from freshwater to ocean fishing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op Play: Raid content to catch special fish with friends is in development.</p>","achievements":{"total":0},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2131550?t=1757916885","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131550/d9120a5fa8a60edbc8add16dd498c11b72ba1dfd/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757916885","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131550/377b6f927bd7ce8d876460804118402611bd5763/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757916885","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131550/377b6f927bd7ce8d876460804118402611bd5763/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757916885","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131550/extras/10089696424b89655991beeffd4ebe7f.poster.avif?t=1757916885\" width=616 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131550/extras/10089696424b89655991beeffd4ebe7f.webm?t=1757916885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131550/extras/10089696424b89655991beeffd4ebe7f.mp4?t=1757916885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fishing Online</strong> lets you explore the joy of fishing in beautiful natural settings\u2014online. Join friends or global players and experience a relaxing fishing life together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25a0 The Fun of Fishing</str